meridian oss
============

java 21 services (replacing the C++ binaries below; see MIGRATION_PROGRESS.md)

  build:   mvn verify                  (Java 21, Spring Boot 3.5; golden tests vs contracts/)
  run:     tools/run-local.sh          (Postgres + Kafka via ops/compose.yaml, the three
                                        services, dashboard on :8000; `stop` to tear down)
  parity:  tools/parity/http-diff.sh   (live services vs frozen contracts/http)
           java -jar services/billing-service/target/billing-service-*[0-9T].jar billing-run \
             --period 2026-07 --json > "${r:=$(mktemp)}" && cmp "$r" contracts/register/register-2026-07.jsonl

  inventory-service  :8081  /sites /circuits /capacity, scheduled ingest of data/,
                            publishes usage to Kafka topic meridian.usage.v1
  billing-service    :8082  /invoices; billing-run batch (same CLI and --json feed);
                            consumes meridian.usage.v1
  network-service    :8084  /ipam/report /ipam/report.txt /devices /reserved-ranges /snmp-targets
  db-migration              one-shot split of meridian.db + billing/accounts + network/ into
                            the per-service PostgreSQL databases

the C++ binaries and Makefile were retired after parity; contracts/ keeps their frozen
output and the golden tests hold the Java services to it.

dashboard/ pages read their API base URLs from dashboard/config.js (served on :8000 by
tools/run-local.sh). dashboard/capacity.html is the sales desk capacity check:
available = total - allocated, we do not hold back a maintenance buffer.

data/ holds the telemetry drops. billing/accounts/ is the account master.

billing rules (services/billing-service/.../rules), composed by InvoiceComposer:

  RatingRule       whole gigabytes, partial gigs round up, $10 a gig over plan
  ProrationRule    30 day billing month, mid cycle plan changes split on it
  PromoRule        promo credits expire at the end of the cycle they were issued
  SuspensionRule   a suspended line is billed the full month, no credit
  LinesRule        3-9 lines 5% off recurring, 10+ lines 10%
  LateFeeRule      10 day grace after the due date, then 1.5% of the balance
  TaxRule          GST/HST on the pre discount amount, PST/QST on what is paid
  DiscountsRule    loyalty credit off the subtotal

the provinces we bill are BC, AB, ON and QC. the province is on the account
record (PROVINCE=) and on the invoice register page.

vantage-telco rates the same accounts differently. tools/parity in that repo
runs both registers off the same usage feed and prints the differences.

contacts: ops-eng (pager), billing questions -> finance
